From 36eb6cb216c2514bd4ec6995319ac4ef0c1c26cb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nikman800 <nikman70055@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 02:45:08 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Build with MinGW-w64 against the prebuilt Windows Dawn

gpu.cpp: with a Dawn DLL built by MSVC only the C API links from GCC; build the
DawnInstanceDescriptor from its C layout and list adapters through
RequestAdapter (AURORA_DAWN_C_API_ONLY). Lower-case Windows SDK header names
(MinGW's are on a case-sensitive file system) and MinGW's import libraries.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
